                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The agreement on aid to Turkey was signed at Ankara by Ambassador Wilson and
                    Turkish Prime Minister Saka on July 12, 1947; for text, see Department of State
                    Treaties and Other International Acts Series No. 1629, or 61 Stat. (pt. 3)
                    2953.</p>
            </div>
